# CODEOWNERS · MyCity App ERP
#
# Who must approve a change, by path. With "Require review from Code Owners"
# on the main branch rule, a PR touching a path below cannot merge until one of
# that path's owners (not the author) approves.
#
# Rules this file keeps, checked by scripts/check/codeowners.js:
#  - the LAST matching line wins, so general paths come first, specific last
#  - every line has two owners or more: the owner, then a backup. GitHub does
#    not count an author's own approval, so a single-owner path could never
#    merge a PR opened by that owner
#  - GE and TB are on every line, so an approval from either one is enough
#    for any path (decided 15 October 2026); the path's own owner comes first
#  - every module folder and every feature guide has its own line
#  - usernames are real: GitHub silently ignores one it cannot resolve
#
# GE @swizfcodes · TB @tomblakeasaah196 · AJ @Ghosted34 · LA @LovedataX
#
# docs/PROGRESS.md has no owner on purpose: every PR edits it.

